{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class C {\n    private static final int INF = (int)1e6;\n    private static int[][][][] memo;\n    private static String inputStr;\n\n    private static int dp(int idx, int pos, int neg, int carry) {\n        int trueCarry = carry - 50;\n        if (idx == 17) {\n            return (pos + neg + trueCarry == 0) ? 0 : INF;\n        }\n        if (memo[idx][pos][neg][carry] != -1) {\n            return memo[idx][pos][neg][carry];\n        }\n        int minCost = INF;\n        int maxPos = Math.min(15, pos);\n        int maxNeg = Math.min(15, neg);\n        for (int i = 0; i <= maxPos; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j <= maxNeg; j++) {\n                int total = pos - neg + trueCarry;\n                int digit = (total % 10 + 10) % 10;\n                int nextCarry = total > 0 ? total / 10 : (total - 9) / 10;\n                if (digit != inputStr.charAt(idx) - '0') continue;\n                int cost = dp(idx + 1, pos - i, neg - j, nextCarry + 50) + (i + j) * (idx + 1);\n                if (cost < minCost) minCost = cost;\n            }\n        }\n        memo[idx][pos][neg][carry] = minCost;\n        return minCost;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        int bound = 50;\n        memo = new int[20][bound][bound][100];\n        for (int i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < bound; j++) {\n                for (int k = 0; k < bound; k++) {\n                    Arrays.fill(memo[i][j][k], -1);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        inputStr = Long.toString(n);\n        while (inputStr.length() < 17) {\n            inputStr = \"0\" + inputStr;\n        }\n        inputStr = new StringBuilder(inputStr).reverse().toString();\n        int result = INF;\n        for (int p = 0; p < bound; p++) {\n            for (int q = 0; q < bound; q++) {\n                int candidate = dp(0, p, q, 50);\n                if (candidate < result) result = candidate;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <climits>\n#include <cstring>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int INF = (int)1e6;\nvector<vector<vector<vector<int>>>> memo;\nstring inputStr;\n\nint dp(int idx, int pos, int neg, int carry) {\n    int trueCarry = carry - 50;\n    if (idx == 17) {\n        return (pos + neg + trueCarry == 0) ? 0 : INF;\n    }\n    if (memo[idx][pos][neg][carry] != -1) {\n        return memo[idx][pos][neg][carry];\n    }\n    int minCost = INF;\n    int maxPos = min(15, pos);\n    int maxNeg = min(15, neg);\n    for (int i = 0; i <= maxPos; i++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j <= maxNeg; j++) {\n            int total = pos - neg + trueCarry;\n            int digit = (total % 10 + 10) % 10;\n            int nextCarry;\n            if (total > 0) {\n                nextCarry = total / 10;\n            } else {\n                nextCarry = (total - 9) / 10;\n            }\n            if (digit != inputStr[idx] - '0') continue;\n            int cost = dp(idx + 1, pos - i, neg - j, nextCarry + 50) + (i + j) * (idx + 1);\n            if (cost < minCost) minCost = cost;\n        }\n    }\n    memo[idx][pos][neg][carry] = minCost;\n    return minCost;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    cin >> n;\n    int bound = 50;\n    memo = vector<vector<vector<vector<int>>>>(20, vector<vector<vector<int>>>(bound, vector<vector<int>>(bound, vector<int>(100, -1))));\n    string inputStrTemp = to_string(n);\n    while (inputStrTemp.length() < 17) {\n        inputStrTemp = \"0\" + inputStrTemp;\n    }\n    reverse(inputStrTemp.begin(), inputStrTemp.end());\n    inputStr = inputStrTemp;\n    int result = INF;\n    for (int p = 0; p < bound; p++) {\n        for (int q = 0; q < bound; q++) {\n            int candidate = dp(0, p, q, 50);\n            if (candidate < result) result = candidate;\n        }\n    }\n    cout << result << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00010525626566959545, -2.50339189733495e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.0013862771447747946, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0007002285565249622, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -1.156323378381785e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.11472927033901215, -2.50339189733495e-06, -1.168244216387393e-05, 0.0, -0.5265688896179199, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -9.894321920000948e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0006133820279501379, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.0015399513067677617, -0.0003420721332076937, -0.08894054591655731, -0.1602400541305542, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.020724069327116013, -0.12693214416503906, -0.0028325694147497416, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.001053374377079308, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -